<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cómo dormir sin despertarte a las 3 AM y volver a dormir en 10 minutos</title>
<meta name="description" content="Estrategias prácticas para volver a dormir rápido cuando te despiertas de madrugada, sin depender de medicamentos.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: #0B1220;
    --card: #141F33;
    --cta: #A99BFF;
    --cta-hover: #B8ADFF;
    --accent: #8EB7D9;
    --heading: #F7F4ED;
    --body: #AEB8C8;
    --success: #91B9A5;
    --linea: rgba(247,244,237,.10);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    color:var(--body);
    background:var(--bg);
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:600;
    line-height:1.15;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    color:var(--heading);
  }
  img,svg{display:block; max-width:100%;}
  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{
    max-width:760px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 24px;
  }
  .wrap-wide{
    max-width:960px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 24px;
  }
  section{padding:72px 0;}
  @media(max-width:640px){ section{padding:52px 0;} }

  /* Botón principal */
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:10px;
    background:var(--cta);
    color:#191231;
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:1.08rem;
    padding:19px 38px;
    border-radius:10px;
    text-decoration:none;
    border:none;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 6px 0 #7A6DD1;
    transition:transform .12s ease, background .12s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{ transform:translateY(-2px); background:var(--cta-hover); }
  .btn:active{ transform:translateY(2px); box-shadow:0 3px 0 #7A6DD1; }
  .btn-wrap{ text-align:center; }
  .btn-sub{
    margin-top:14px;
    font-size:.95rem;
    color:var(--body);
    font-style:italic;
  }

  /* HERO */
  .hero{
    padding:88px 0 72px;
    text-align:center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% -10%, rgba(142,183,217,.16), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 0%, rgba(169,155,255,.14), transparent 50%),
      var(--bg);
  }
  .badge{
    display:inline-block;
    background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--linea);
    color:var(--accent);
    font-size:.78rem;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    padding:8px 18px;
    border-radius:999px;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:2.7rem;
    max-width:820px;
    margin:0 auto 22px;
  }
  .hero h1 .accent{ color:var(--accent); }
  .hero .sub{
    font-size:1.18rem;
    color:var(--body);
    max-width:600px;
    margin:0 auto 36px;
  }
  @media(max-width:640px){ .hero h1{ font-size:2rem; } .hero{padding:60px 0 48px;} }

  /* SECCIÓN FAMILIAR */
  .familiar{ background:var(--card); }
  .familiar h2{ font-size:2rem; text-align:center; margin-bottom:36px; }
  .checklist{
    list-style:none;
    max-width:600px;
    margin:0 auto;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:18px;
  }
  .checklist li{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    align-items:flex-start;
    font-size:1.05rem;
    color:var(--body);
  }
  .checklist .mark{
    flex:0 0 26px;
    height:26px;
    width:26px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--success);
    color:#0B1220;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    font-size:.85rem;
    margin-top:2px;
  }
  .familiar .closing{
    max-width:560px;
    margin:36px auto 0;
    text-align:center;
    font-size:1.08rem;
    color:var(--body);
  }

  /* SOLUCIÓN */
  .solucion{ text-align:center; }
  .solucion .badge{ background:var(--accent); color:#0B1220; border:none; }
  .solucion h2{ font-size:2.1rem; max-width:680px; margin:22px auto 10px; }
  .solucion .tagline{
    font-size:1.15rem;
    color:var(--success);
    font-weight:600;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .solucion p{ max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; color:var(--body); font-size:1.05rem; }

  /* CÓMO FUNCIONA */
  .funciona{ background:var(--card); }
  .funciona h2{ text-align:center; font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:46px; }
  .pasos{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:28px;
  }
  @media(max-width:760px){ .pasos{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:24px; } }
  .paso{
    background:var(--bg);
    border:1px solid var(--linea);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:28px 24px;
  }
  .paso .num{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:2rem;
    color:var(--accent);
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .paso h3{ font-size:1.15rem; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .paso p{ color:var(--body); font-size:.98rem; }

  /* POR QUÉ FUNCIONA */
  .porque h2{ font-size:1.9rem; text-align:center; max-width:680px; margin:0 auto 34px; }
  .porque .cuerpo{ max-width:640px; margin:0 auto; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:18px; }
  .porque p{ color:var(--body); font-size:1.05rem; }

  /* CTA con precio */
  .cta-block{
    background:var(--card);
    color:var(--heading);
    text-align:center;
    border-top:1px solid var(--linea);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--linea);
  }
  .cta-block .precios{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:14px;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .cta-block .tachado{
    font-size:1.4rem;
    text-decoration:line-through;
    opacity:.55;
    color:var(--body);
  }
  .cta-block .actual{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:3rem;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--heading);
  }
  .cta-block .btn{ background:var(--cta); color:#191231; box-shadow:0 6px 0 #7A6DD1; }
  .cta-block .btn:hover{ background:var(--cta-hover); }
  .cta-block .btn-sub{ color:var(--body); }

  /* HERRAMIENTAS */
  .herramientas h2{ text-align:center; font-size:2rem; }
  .herramientas .subt{ text-align:center; color:var(--body); margin-bottom:44px; font-size:1.05rem; }
  .tools-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:22px;
  }
  @media(max-width:640px){ .tools-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .tool{
    border:1px solid var(--linea);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:26px;
    background:var(--card);
  }
  .tool .icon{
    width:44px; height:44px;
    border-radius:10px;
    background:rgba(142,183,217,.14);
    color:var(--accent);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    margin-bottom:14px;
    font-size:1.3rem;
  }
  .tool h3{ font-size:1.08rem; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .tool p{ color:var(--body); font-size:.96rem; }

  /* TESTIMONIOS */
  .testimonios{ background:var(--card); }
  .testimonios h2{ text-align:center; font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:40px; }
  .test-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:24px;
  }
  @media(max-width:640px){ .test-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .test{
    background:var(--bg);
    border:1px solid var(--linea);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:26px;
  }
  .stars{ color:var(--cta); margin-bottom:12px; letter-spacing:2px; }
  .test p{ font-style:italic; color:var(--body); margin-bottom:14px; }
  .test .autor{ font-weight:600; font-size:.92rem; color:var(--accent); }

  /* FAQ */
  .faq h2{ text-align:center; font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:36px; }
  .faq-item{
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--linea);
    padding:20px 0;
  }
  .faq-item h3{ font-family:'Inter', sans-serif; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:8px; color:var(--heading); }
  .faq-item p{ color:var(--body); font-size:.98rem; }

  /* GARANTÍA */
  .garantia{
    background:var(--card);
    text-align:center;
  }
  .garantia .sello{
    width:64px; height:64px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--success);
    color:#0B1220;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-size:1.6rem;
    margin:0 auto 18px;
  }
  .garantia h2{ font-size:1.7rem; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .garantia p{ max-width:520px; margin:0 auto; color:var(--body); }

  /* POR QUÉ ESTE PRECIO */
  .precio-por-que{ text-align:center; }
  .precio-por-que h2{ font-size:1.9rem; margin-bottom:22px; }
  .precio-por-que .cuerpo{ max-width:580px; margin:0 auto; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px; color:var(--body); font-size:1.05rem; }

  /* CTA FINAL */
  .cta-final{
    background:#070C16;
    color:var(--heading);
    text-align:center;
  }
  .cta-final h2{ font-size:2.2rem; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .cta-final .copy{ font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--body); margin-bottom:30px; }
  .cta-final .precios{ display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:center; gap:14px; margin-bottom:28px; }
  .cta-final .tachado{ font-size:1.3rem; text-decoration:line-through; opacity:.55; color:var(--body); }
  .cta-final .actual{ font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-size:2.6rem; color:var(--cta); }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer{
    background:#070C16;
    color:var(--body);
    text-align:center;
    padding:40px 0 32px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--linea);
  }
  footer .flogo{ font-family:'Fraunces', serif; color:var(--heading); font-size:1.15rem; margin-bottom:6px; }
  footer .ftag{ font-size:.9rem; margin-bottom:20px; }
  footer .flinks a{ text-decoration:none; color:var(--body); font-size:.9rem; }
  footer .fcopy{ font-size:.82rem; margin-top:18px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.45); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="badge">PARA PERSONAS QUE NO PUEDEN VOLVER A DORMIR</span>
    <h1>Cómo dormir sin despertarte a las <span class="accent">3 AM</span><br>y volver a dormir en 10 minutos</h1>
    <p class="sub">Si sabes que te despiertas en medio de la noche pero no puedes volver a dormir, si quieres descansar profundamente y sentirte renovado por la mañana... esta herramienta te ayudará a lograrlo.</p>
    <div class="btn-wrap">
      <a class="btn" href="https://pay.hotmart.com/E106633237V">Quiero Dormir Mejor Ahora</a>
      <p class="btn-sub">Porque no quiero que el insomnio controle tu vida.</p>
